---
import PageShell from "../components/PageShell.astro";
---

<PageShell title="Book Waitlist | The 100 Hackathoner" description="Follow Sayyid Khan's journey to 100 hackathons. Join the waitlist for book updates and practical lessons from building, shipping, and learning in public.">
  <section class="section waitlist-section">
    <div class="container waitlist-grid">
      <div class="waitlist-copy">
        <p class="meta">The next chapter</p>
        <h1>100 hackathons.<br />Lessons worth keeping.</h1>
        <p class="lede">I’m turning this journey into a book about the decisions, mistakes, and people behind the demos. Join the waitlist to hear when the next chapter is ready.</p>
        <ul class="updates">
          <li><strong>Lessons from the next build</strong><span>Practical notes on testing ideas, working with teams, and shipping under pressure.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Book progress</strong><span>Updates as the stories and lessons take shape.</span></li>
          <li><strong>Launch news</strong><span>Hear when the book is ready. There’s no release date to promise yet.</span></li>
        </ul>
        <a class="journey-link" href="/hackathons/">Explore the journey so far <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </div>
      <aside class="signup-card" aria-labelledby="signup-heading">
        <p class="meta">Stay in the loop</p>
        <h2 id="signup-heading">Join the waitlist.</h2>
        <p>Get occasional hackathon lessons and updates on the book. Enter your email, then confirm your signup in your inbox.</p>
        <div class="waitlist-embed">
          <script is:inline async data-uid="c044e7efca" src="https://the-100-hackathoner.kit.com/c044e7efca/index.js"></script>
        </div>
        <p class="signup-fallback">Having trouble with the form? <a href="https://the-100-hackathoner.kit.com/c044e7efca">Open the signup page ↗</a>.</p>
        <p class="privacy-note">By joining, you agree to receive hackathon lessons and book updates from Sayyid. Unsubscribe anytime using the link in each email.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>
</PageShell>

<style>
  .waitlist-section { min-height: 70vh; }
  .waitlist-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.2fr) minmax(320px, .8fr); gap: clamp(36px, 7vw, 110px); align-items: start; }
  h1 { margin: 18px 0 0; }
  .lede { max-width: 60ch; color: var(--muted); font-size: 1.15rem; line-height: 1.75; margin: 28px 0; }
  .updates { list-style: none; margin: 36px 0; padding: 0; }
  .updates li { display: grid; gap: 8px; padding: 20px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); }
  .updates strong { font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink); }
  .updates span { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  .journey-link, .signup-fallback a { text-decoration: underline; text-underline-offset: 4px; }
  .signup-card { border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; padding: clamp(24px, 3vw, 40px); background: var(--raised); }
  .signup-card h2 { font-size: 2rem; margin: 18px 0; }
  .signup-card > p:not(.meta) { color: var(--muted); line-height: 1.65; }
  .waitlist-embed { margin-top: 28px; }
  .waitlist-embed :global(.formkit-form) { max-width: 100%; width: 100%; }
  .waitlist-embed :global(.formkit-input) { background: var(--bg) !important; color: var(--ink) !important; border-color: var(--line-strong) !important; }
  .waitlist-embed :global(.formkit-input::placeholder) { color: var(--muted); opacity: 1; }
  .waitlist-embed :global(.formkit-powered-by-convertkit) { background: #fff; border-radius: 4px; padding: 4px 8px; }
  .signup-fallback, .privacy-note { font-size: .8rem; line-height: 1.6; color: var(--muted); }
  .signup-fallback { border-top: 1px solid var(--line); padding-top: 22px; margin-top: 24px; }
  a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible, button:focus-visible { outline: 2px solid var(--accent); outline-offset: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .waitlist-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }
</style>
